    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a research assistant helping a student quickly understand a paper.\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nAbstract: {{ $json.abstract }}\n\nWrite a natural, flowing 3-sentence explanation of this paper for someone skimming research in this field. Vary your sentence structure and opening phrases each time — do not start with \"This paper solves\" or use the phrase \"key takeaway.\" Write as if explaining it casually to a colleague, focusing on what makes THIS paper's approach distinct from typical work in its area.\n\nAlso extract 5 relevant keywords.\n\nRespond with ONLY valid JSON in this exact format, no markdown, no code fences:\n{\"summary\": \"...\", \"keywords\": [\"kw1\", \"kw2\", \"kw3\", \"kw4\", \"kw5\"]}",
